    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University's Medical College and Centre for Innovation in Medical Education (CIME) proudly hosted the first-ever MRCP PACES (Practical Assessment of Clinical Examination Skills) exam in collaboration with the Federation of the Royal Colleges of Physicians of the UK. This milestone establishes CIME as an approved MRCP PACES exam site in Karachi, offering physicians a globally recognised pathway to advance their medical careers without the need to travel abroad.",
